          duration-300
          ease-[cubic-bezier(0.165,0.85,0.45,1)] h-8 w-8 rounded-md active:scale-95 backdrop-blur-md _ghost_x02hl_49" type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" data-state="closed"><div class="relative"><div class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M12.5 3A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 14 4.5V6h1.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 17 7.5v8a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 6 15.5V14H4.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 12.5v-8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4.5 3zm1.5 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H7v1.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5H14zM4.5 4a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5v8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5z"></path></svg></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M15.188 5.11a.5.5 0 0 1 .752.626l-.056.084-7.5 9a.5.5 0 0 1-.738.033l-3.5-3.5-.064-.078a.501.501 0 0 1 .693-.693l.078.064 3.113 3.113 7.15-8.58z"></path></svg></div></div></div></button></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-lg !text-sm !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre-wrap;"><span><span>[Left Panel]          [Right Panel / Preview]
</span></span><span>  Color picker         SVG Car render
</span><span>  Wheel selector       "Live" badge / shine effect
</span><span>  Texture overlay      Color name + hex
</span><span>  Primary/Secondary    Export / Share button</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>3. Color System from JSON</strong>
GTA Online has distinct paint categories — Chrome, Matte, Metallic, Pearlescent, etc. Your UI should:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Group colors by type with a tab or pill filter</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Show swatches (not just names)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Reflect finish type visually — matte colors should render flat, metallic ones should have a subtle gradient/shimmer CSS effect on the SVG</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>4. Wheel Rendering</strong>
Wheels are a great opportunity for crisp SVG icons per wheel family (Lowrider, Sport, Muscle, Offroad, etc.) — drawn as circular SVG components with spoke patterns.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>5. Texture Overlays</strong>
For liveries/textures, a CSS <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">mix-blend-mode</code> overlay on the car SVG body works extremely well — lets you layer a pattern over a base color realistically.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Tech Approach (React + Tailwind)</h3>
<div class="overflow-x-auto w-full px-2 mb-6"><table class="min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal"><thead class="text-left"><tr><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Feature</th><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Recommended Approach</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Car body</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">SVG with dynamic <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">fill</code> bound to state</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Color swatches</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">JSON-mapped <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">div</code> grid with Tailwind ring on select</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Metallic/matte finish</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">CSS gradient or <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">filter: brightness()</code> on SVG layer</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Wheel display</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Inline SVG components per wheel type</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Texture</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">SVG <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">&lt;image&gt;</code> or CSS <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">background-blend-mode</code> overlay</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Share/export</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top"><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">html2canvas</code> screenshot of the preview panel</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">What Would Help Me Build This</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">To give you a working prototype or production-quality component, I'd love to see:</p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>The JSON structure</strong> — how are colors, wheels, and textures shaped? (keys, categories, any hex values included or just names?)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Your existing code</strong> — component structure, routing, any state management (Context, Zustand, etc.)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Vehicle scope</strong> — is this one generic car silhouette, or do users pick a vehicle model first?</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Design direction</strong> — does it need to match your existing site's dark/light theme?</li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Once I have those, I can build you a full React component with live preview, or a standalone prototype you can drop into your existing codebase. Want to share the code and JSON?</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
