A: Inside the canvas as a floating HUD (bottom corner)</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Q: How should vehicle switching work?
A: Tab row above the canvas (class icons/names)</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Q: Canvas aspect ratio — how tall should the preview be?
A: Square-ish (4/3) — maximum car size</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><span class="text-text-500 text-xs flex items-center mr-2" data-state="closed">Mar 7</span><div class="flex items-center"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
