:</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto w-full px-2 mb-6"><table class="min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal"><thead class="text-left"><tr><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Tab</th><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Model file</th><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">🔥 Muscle</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">mustang.glb</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ Ready</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">⚡ Sports</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">wrx.glb</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ Mapped</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">🏎 Super</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">turismo.glb</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ Mapped</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">🚙 SUV</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">granger.glb</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ Mapped</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✨ Coupe</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">felon.glb</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ Mapped</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">🚗 Sedan</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">stafford.glb</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ Mapped</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">🛻 Off-Road</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">rebel.glb</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ Mapped</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Just drop the 6 remaining GLBs into <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">/public/models/</code> and each tab will load automatically. The picker is still available on each tab in case any mesh assignments need tweaking after you see them in action.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 py-2"><div class="flex text-left font-ui rounded-lg overflow-hidden border-0.5 transition duration-300 w-full hover:bg-bg-000/50 px-4 border-border-300/15 hover:border-border-200" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Open artifact: Carpreview"><div class="artifact-block-cell group/artifact-block flex flex-1 align-start justify-between w-full"><div class="flex flex-1 gap-2 min-w-0"><div class="flex items-end w-[68px] relative shrink-0"><div class="absolute right-2 flex flex-1 overflow-hidden w-[52px] h-[71px] rounded-t-lg border-0.5 border-border-200 select-none scale-[1] group-hover/artifact-block:scale-[1.035] -rotate-[0.1rad] group-hover/artifact-block:-rotate-[0.065rad] duration-300 ease-out group-hover/artifact-block:duration-400 group-hover/artifact-block:ease-[cubic-bezier(0,0.9,0.5,1.35)] transition-transform backface-hidden will-change-transform translate-y-[19%] bg-gradient-to-b from-bg-000 to-bg-000/0 pt-4 items-start justify-center h-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="text-text-500"><path d="M67.84,92.61,25.37,128l42.47,35.39a6,6,0,1,1-7.68,9.22l-48-40a6,6,0,0,1,0-9.22l48-40a6,6,0,0,1,7.68,9.22Zm176,30.78-48-40a6,6,0,1,0-7.68,9.22L230.63,128l-42.47,35.39a6,6,0,1,0,7.68,9.22l48-40a6,6,0,0,0,0-9.22Zm-81.79-89A6,6,0,0,0,154.36,38l-64,176A6,6,0,0,0,94,221.64a6.15,6.15,0,0,0,2,.36,6,6,0,0,0,5.64-3.95l64-176A6,6,0,0,0,162.05,34.36Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-4 min-w-0 fle