ls like a screenshot, invite link, or specific callouts (e.g. mentioning the BEFF section is coming soon)?</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">The response was: Tone: Hype / energetic, Include: Ping @everyone, List the features, Tease upcoming BEFF tool, Link to website, Call to action</p></div></div><div class="pl-2 pt-1 pb-2"><div class="font-ui bg-bg-000 rounded-2xl rounded-t-3xl overflow-hidden border-border-300 border -mx-1 mb-4 transition-colors focus-within:border-accent-200/50 focus-within:shadow-md"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="overflow-y-auto max-h-[400px]"><div style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px); transform: none;"><textarea placeholder="Write your message..." class="px-5 pt-4 pb-4 w-full resize-none bg-transparent border-none text-sm text-text-100 placeholder:text-text-500 !outline-none !ring-0" style="field-sizing: content; min-height: 200px;">@everyone

⚙️ **THE CAR BUILDER IS LIVE** ⚙️

https://www.stellacrewgaming.com/car-builder

We just dropped something the crew has been waiting for. The **Stella Crew Car Builder** lets you visualize your entire GTA Online build in real-time 3D — before you spend a single chip.

**What's in it:**
🎨  222+ paint codes across every type — Metallic, Matte, Chameleon, Chrome, Worn, Util, Metals
🔩  63 wheel styles with full preview
🚗  7 vehicle classes — Muscle, Sports, Super, SUV, Coupe, Sedan, Off-Road
✨  Pearlescent overlay, crew color, secondary paint — all live
🖥️  Full 3D interactive model — drag, rotate, zoom

No more guessing what Anodized Red looks like on your whip. Just open it, pick your colors, done.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
🔜  **BEFF Tool is next.** Full drawable/texture reference with component search — coming to the site soon.
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Drop your builds in &lt;#builds-channel&gt; and let us know what you want added. Every piece of feedback shapes what gets built next.

🔗 **stellacrewgaming.com/car-builder**</textarea></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 px-2 py-2"><div class="flex items-center h-8 bg-bg-000 rounded-lg border-0.5 border-border-300 shadow-sm overflow-hidden"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
